            <h2>Why Choose Wildemere Vet?</h2>
            <p>We combine cutting-edge veterinary technology with compassionate care to ensure the best outcomes for your pets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <i class="fas fa-user-md"></i>
